{
  "task_id": "ccnp_multiarea_ospf_intermediate",
  "description": "Multi-area OSPF deployment across 5 routers. Area 0 (backbone) contains R1 and the backbone links of R2 and R3. R2 is the ABR for Area 1 (R2-R4 link and R4); R3 is the ABR for Area 2 (R3-R5 link and R5). Use router-ids 10.0.0.N for RN. Configure OSPF with the correct area assignments, summarize Area 1 as 10.1.0.0/16 at R2 and Area 2 as 10.2.0.0/16 at R3, and verify end-to-end reachability between the two non-backbone areas.\n\nIP Addressing Plan:\n- R1: eth1=10.0.12.1/30, eth2=10.0.13.1/30, lo=10.0.0.1/32\n- R2: eth1=10.0.12.2/30, eth2=10.1.24.1/30, lo=10.0.0.2/32\n- R3: eth1=10.0.13.2/30, eth2=10.2.35.1/30, lo=10.0.0.3/32\n- R4: eth1=10.1.24.2/30, lo=10.1.255.4/32\n- R5: eth1=10.2.35.2/30, lo=10.2.255.5/32",
  "platform": "frr",
  "evaluation_mode": "multi_turn",
